{
  "version": 1,
  "updatedAt": "2026-11-14T10:27:03.797Z",
  "lastRefillAt": "2026-11-09T04:28:24.814Z",
  "current": {
    "text": "You can mark a difficult experience honestly without making it the headline of every new possibility.",
    "fingerprint": "90e5390afc19ee7e375f4da7632157f60a6a5625cec9ccadf36b01499089f59c",
    "source": "ai",
    "slot": 166171,
    "at": "2026-11-14T10:27:03.797Z"
  },
  "pending": [
    {
      "text": "A helpful note left for tomorrow can be an act of care for the person who will pick up the work.",
      "fingerprint": "95082873a61d4ec31fb5a10b1b3a58db15c3b1f2ecd4e1553a9efd5c2f8ebff5",
      "source": "ai"
    },
    {
      "text": "A missed opportunity may deserve disappointment without requiring you to stop noticing the doors around it.",
      "fingerprint": "ffa31a1d2750d1d22a28457dd42e390df1c0b3a73a1c7aab95bbda560e89898c",
      "source": "ai"
    },
    {
      "text": "A boundary can make a good commitment more honest by giving it the time and attention you can actually offer.",
      "fingerprint": "ffaadcee3f797333235aecb88100b4115001d40945e0e09db3259d9d855a2225",
      "source": "ai"
    },
    {
      "text": "You can name a disappointment without adding a prediction about every attempt that follows.",
      "fingerprint": "88b09cd8752c6c5da5a6ada5c18c506f5dc5e8e50c5577fcba05a7293a8b77fe",
      "source": "ai"
    },
    {
      "text": "An ordinary week can hold work you respect, company you enjoy, and room to be a person between tasks.",
      "fingerprint": "d0edf1421e6972bea247292d96dca32c1daecf90df9b9cacaf10a85b00fb0275",
      "source": "ai"
    },
    {
      "text": "Before calling yourself stuck, check whether the next task is really several tasks wearing one name.",
      "fingerprint": "3d5086d5f3608639ea408ac4fe4e7194962c0965ad57e359e41fd53a1ede1729",
      "source": "ai"
    },
    {
      "text": "You are permitted to enjoy a day that does not become a story worth telling.",
      "fingerprint": "58ee9a0e56cb93f985c46023456f297b3db96f2792b076eddc3ae9c8f8e3c899",
      "source": "ai"
    },
    {
      "text": "A fresh start can be as plain as opening the file and reading the last note you left.",
      "fingerprint": "079021fc1168205053f77873430435948a40c318551d879e49ebcd6c3c703a61",
      "source": "ai"
    },
    {
      "text": "A useful goal can tell you where to place your attention without deciding how much you are worth.",
      "fingerprint": "d8b9e4fcff8faafcf9ab172abc8c5e906ea3e053b5b69a7714231c58b6cfe141",
      "source": "ai"
    },
    {
      "text": "You can honor an earlier version of yourself without keeping every choice that version made.",
      "fingerprint": "acef77cd10333ee24da0d6680694a9160296a3ad43bb81545c17934872a548b4",
      "source": "ai"
    },
    {
      "text": "A difficult reply can wait long enough for you to choose words that serve the conversation.",
      "fingerprint": "21020cfdff8dc9493ace2efb3088796521eab9de0a84e9aa0f72185ada26c566",
      "source": "ai"
    },
    {
      "text": "It takes care to say that a task needs more time. Clear notice can serve others better than a rushed promise.",
      "fingerprint": "e5273d095f5d6589ba5662a4bb0151ec5b201db3c3ca47526cf89ae4c4428b4b",
      "source": "ai"
    },
    {
      "text": "Try thanking yourself for the care taken in a difficult attempt, even while deciding what you would change.",
      "fingerprint": "99ff5b398cb04fcbe0b149981fa1c3a6eab29245e00d6fee966550f82a9bfaa0",
      "source": "ai"
    },
    {
      "text": "Keep some questions open while you gather experience. Not every uncertainty requires an immediate opinion.",
      "fingerprint": "b65a50c533758dcf4f37c48069df61ee94ffa52af1088ceab5252b0526e65e17",
      "source": "ai"
    },
    {
      "text": "There is no need to hide the simple method that helped you. Someone else may be looking for an accessible beginning.",
      "fingerprint": "daa2973c02018923360c5356d244a8f7deefdcbbe5b3b413256914688a787ddc",
      "source": "ai"
    },
    {
      "text": "Leave a margin in the plan for the tasks you cannot predict and the person you cannot schedule perfectly.",
      "fingerprint": "e40cc54b94fd12fe69509953e665a7d7b843b9299030a79210a1a05f8d9b8836",
      "source": "ai"
    },
    {
      "text": "If you are waiting to feel fully ready, identify one part you could safely rehearse instead.",
      "fingerprint": "65cf90cc5080e81639688ca6aab51cf0f0ae65bac28a4ad1ef31da6e8ea58b63",
      "source": "ai"
    },
    {
      "text": "A reason to continue can be modest: a detail worth understanding, a person worth helping, or a task worth completing.",
      "fingerprint": "bb2d844a7392a78d2509dc06121a187f6343c0ab058a39535e20854f89131d3a",
      "source": "ai"
    },
    {
      "text": "When a new responsibility feels large, ask which decisions are yours and which ones can be made together.",
      "fingerprint": "4ef2e6cc214417c1edfd39d23ba221b6435ee770c78605e004c494c908c8c65e",
      "source": "ai"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spend a few minutes with the question before reaching for the answer you usually give.",
      "fingerprint": "2f4372b13ccf74088d3a2b4a953364fa4800381eaf21d1dd95089c697e97efe4",
      "source": "ai"
    },
    {
      "text": "An idea that survives a gentle test is more useful than an idea you have had to protect from every question.",
      "fingerprint": "84005ca103302b2549016467d25eac6f77bc6a0803c345f522d52e3a16b1f641",
      "source": "ai"
    },
    {
      "text": "A skill learned for one purpose may quietly become useful in a place you did not expect.",
      "fingerprint": "8f1b95b54a634a572224e59b641dc1016e434138be161b3c779ebd5bebb1208d",
      "source": "ai"
    },
    {
      "text": "There is room in a serious effort for an afternoon that is mostly practice and correction.",
      "fingerprint": "67194ce01d361db915639ca5b69d428c89b757790da20acbfc2c1e590f618daf",
      "source": "ai"
    },
    {
      "text": "You can respect the effort a plan took and still admit that it no longer fits the situation.",
      "fingerprint": "5ba2fcf889b89d650a35672818f5d121f6ec3bc9f6273d07a8e04d9f19841af9",
      "source": "ai"
    },
    {
      "text": "A break from measuring can help you remember what you liked about the activity before it became a goal.",
      "fingerprint": "8b1f1a6f09e6edf930a647647c945b516aefffaa905d58be277829bc52d0e0e0",
      "source": "ai"
    },
    {
      "text": "Good company can make a hard learning season less lonely, even when each person has different work to do.",
      "fingerprint": "8c9dd5d318156efbed6bdab2252cd8f628adfd3c1cb8ac721c8a3c7f4aebbe80",
      "source": "ai"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make a place for the things that interest you even when you cannot yet explain their practical value.",
      "fingerprint": "c2abac98e89602a7a7f0c8e598a263f513b311e9454b97f1eb33eb7cb47dc608",
      "source": "ai"
    },
    {
      "text": "The courage to disagree can be quiet and precise. You can explain a concern without turning it into a contest.",
      "fingerprint": "3814628debd50b7131a07793538a447b5bd99c864eb898cb35d4493a8c14dfeb",
      "source": "ai"
    },
    {
      "text": "Choose a task you can describe in one clear sentence. Give that sentence a chance to guide the next hour.",
      "fingerprint": "ab8aeac69edd7b560aafc0c08468280c15f862a85f05c6235f52f4a79bda82b3",
      "source": "ai"
    },
    {
      "text": "A fair review of your work should notice the care you took as well as the detail you missed.",
      "fingerprint": "4fab478e18fb9f68a158be9794a729fa91c90d2ef1fc0bf8bce4c3f5c2e7aa66",
      "source": "ai"
    },
    {
      "text": "When your standards rise, remember that noticing finer details is itself a result of learning.",
      "fingerprint": "cce0f60bad599bc63ef499d4b4212016f04c88269c4232df58f44cc1ecc70fb0",
      "source": "ai"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remember to ask what went well while you are tracing what went wrong. Both belong in a useful account.",
      "fingerprint": "9ed28ec1aa22e7e93b53c286f4a582654ecee00efa7616b7f36054159babd4a8",
      "source": "ai"
    },
    {
      "text": "You do not have to answer every request at once to be a thoughtful person to work with.",
      "fingerprint": "bb90a0d18c110a0baa84e26a5ddaa4f703068db78132493327561eb885f5b60f",
      "source": "ai"
    },
    {
      "text": "When the room feels rushed, one calm question about what matters most may be a useful contribution.",
      "fingerprint": "13042edd677047f015f6cc52222808002a2c6de40e7328ac97c356205afa5024",
      "source": "ai"
    },
    {
      "text": "Repetition can teach you to hear differences that were invisible when everything was new.",
      "fingerprint": "82ac3c5439e1ebf71d3076659cf2843bc97ee87c255f0c9ab5200b815e62ba6f",
      "source": "ai"
    },
    {
      "text": "You are allowed to finish a conversation with something to think about instead of something to prove.",
      "fingerprint": "df5e9ec59f1ecbba8e0a815f076249e41271e029bf2b5e0529d92ffc412e3f49",
      "source": "ai"
    },
    {
      "text": "The decision to stop polishing can be part of doing the work well. Ask whether another change would help its purpose.",
      "fingerprint": "9f19d4c18697b25cadffe7f6567421debbfc05a69d23f678e80d86f7818a5f68",
      "source": "ai"
    },
    {
      "text": "Let a moment of doubt lead to a fair question rather than a harsh conclusion.",
      "fingerprint": "f0bd24afb16b3684f2fff7095d283da0ffb48313ad68bb450b843b082ade12cc",
      "source": "ai"
    },
    {
      "text": "There is pleasure in making an ordinary thing easier to use. Notice when your care removes a little friction.",
      "fingerprint": "0055618d28c11131bf4c1786e4fb0f0a040354858a0c867cdff38cfffb0e172e",
      "source": "ai"
    },
    {
      "text": "Before filling a free moment, consider whether you would rather leave it free.",
      "fingerprint": "4e0fd60da50ebba7bcd77943bf81c5a54e530ad8b776e0251437b19f67854840",
      "source": "ai"
    },
    {
      "text": "Consider what would make the task easier to return to after an interruption, and arrange that before you leave.",
      "fingerprint": "81f1255631c33c8ac4b07ebaf85abfcd3fe6c3efcda0ca39aa6928058918f2be",
      "source": "ai"
    },
    {
      "text": "Useful preparation can include deciding who to ask when you reach the part you do not understand.",
      "fingerprint": "eba6fb7c4b032b4d4da6a59fdfed9a67a43f51e65e2aa8e44d349e2c82175d0d",
      "source": "ai"
    },
    {
      "text": "Try noticing when a familiar task takes less effort than it once did. Growth sometimes becomes visible through ease.",
      "fingerprint": "16c40566f012cf9d2caf2e2ce208980834cc972691dc6187f3b39544283691d0",
      "source": "ai"
    },
    {
      "text": "Allow your plans to include the time it takes to finish, explain, and put things away.",
      "fingerprint": "78ec4b719e9f433f59c0fa74a51d6b921fb1d2769e0e0b47d9d547b1dd18434d",
      "source": "ai"
    },
    {
      "text": "You can belong to a community while learning at a pace and in a manner that differ from its loudest members.",
      "fingerprint": "41619ae03b33dcb5003d2d0b6bbd71b4ccbbc6d18eae72ca597e5656e4d7ada5",
      "source": "ai"
    },
    {
      "text": "The time you spend understanding a constraint may save the next person from mistaking it for a failure of effort.",
      "fingerprint": "5a6e44e25a202faf2a8352d8e7f0afd625b744b9d71b275920667c68cdb84fda",
      "source": "ai"
    },
    {
      "text": "Some satisfaction comes from caring for what already exists rather than always beginning something new.",
      "fingerprint": "c52cc809624c7366ebe72853d3c3210974dab18d8666754bbb2386f87e37c1df",
      "source": "ai"
    },
    {
      "text": "Trying a different example can reveal an idea that the first explanation left out of reach.",
      "fingerprint": "bfc9ffb7d7074ff625b6bda346e2a16ae2cf349a5e4bb1f470e954409d95fd1c",
      "source": "ai"
    },
    {
      "text": "Let the first few minutes of learning be untidy. You are finding the edges of something unfamiliar.",
      "fingerprint": "87a3773f7a5958832871d96feb93e427f6e12b5245afe967ed87e6f7afcf1f25",
      "source": "ai"
    },
    {
      "text": "An honest limit can keep a shared project from being built on an expectation you cannot meet.",
      "fingerprint": "2daa6bf26988f324b59eb76d401a3ccfcbb37ca3c948b9193292e4555a148ac0",
      "source": "ai"
    },
    {
      "text": "Your contribution does not have to be the most visible one to make a shared effort more thoughtful.",
      "fingerprint": "a86d124c2693cfc7103bfb3f5f0f246b69a45fa39a445fa09dcabbd1fe899ff1",
      "source": "ai"
    },
    {
      "text": "An honest invitation to collaborate leaves room for the other person to shape the work too.",
      "fingerprint": "1f40c173ee9cc7faf87e5f923055eaac20810e3a1e76ba9e44c3109fe30406e8",
      "source": "ai"
    },
    {
      "text": "Your reasons for choosing a path can grow more precise as you learn what traveling it actually requires.",
      "fingerprint": "34e5a7cc01a812611ba073daf5e3ee1354a40c543d7449422e9bc7de7e5e3b60",
      "source": "ai"
    },
    {
      "text": "The tools on your desk need not be perfect for you to make something careful with them.",
      "fingerprint": "b7accf56f59b2cac969c56a7a672ec6c52c0ad00e43d0dfca611336977c073e9",
      "source": "ai"
    },
    {
      "text": "A project may ask you to become more patient with details, with other people, and with your own uneven attention.",
      "fingerprint": "7f5aa2109bb2e0e9ce5068a023b96f4a1798c6cca01aa005388a43fb18738e5d",
      "source": "ai"
    },
    {
      "text": "Work that feels simple to you may reflect years of learning that you no longer notice.",
      "fingerprint": "6a3eb599499d473103a68441a34745e99d351d01fa825d413953e1ff7d91580e",
      "source": "ai"
    },
    {
      "text": "When someone offers a different approach, you can examine it without putting your own ability on trial.",
      "fingerprint": "7e367e804b3354dce2014117f4921fc86f81f74f619eee7775cade5bc87bf2b8",
      "source": "ai"
    },
    {
      "text": "A day spent putting scattered notes into order can prepare the ground for work you have not started yet.",
      "fingerprint": "9910d0d9c4dbf448e61c3ef10e710cc84c04992b58cc06aa459554c700103874",
      "source": "ai"
    },
    {
      "text": "Notice which parts of the work make you more attentive to the people who will use it.",
      "fingerprint": "d8dbfbe1f3b14d4e3568e405170dcaee359ec2656ec5cc8cb014601ceca607c4",
      "source": "ai"
    }
  ],
  "recent": [
    {
      "text": "You do not have to earn rest by reaching exhaustion. Protect the person doing the work.",
      "fingerprint": "3a9fd1622ed24443add7d90e48e8d2a949e881b962dccd3dc8bc4b8de5456c98",
      "source": "ai",
      "slot": 166116,
      "at": "2026-11-07T13:02:08.468Z"
    },
    {
      "text": "Keep one small promise to your future self today, and let that quiet follow-through become tomorrow's confidence.",
      "fingerprint": "884b4f962ab8e1f2b6e7b3e8510bfc6d4f1e54d180fa54e58d3dbde4eb0e6802",
      "source": "ai",
      "slot": 166117,
      "at": "2026-11-07T15:00:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "text": "A little patience with today's practice can protect a tomorrow you are still learning how to build.",
      "fingerprint": "aaef60f93ee722e38debae3056e95b0bbcc07933d136a7024e2c20a7a31f6787",
      "source": "ai",
      "slot": 166118,
      "at": "2026-11-07T19:26:22.481Z"
    },
    {
      "text": "The work you leave easier for the next person is a contribution, even when your name is nowhere on it.",
      "fingerprint": "467266f3081503161edf85fbea3cf39308a3564873b20e1e22b9979f25950351",
      "source": "ai",
      "slot": 166119,
      "at": "2026-11-07T21:00:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "text": "Some courage looks like telling a trusted person that you are unsure and would value their perspective.",
      "fingerprint": "8cdf9193da3cdf3ca462c78761ad2d62c657fe965fdbcde102529d67f91a4aac",
      "source": "ai",
      "slot": 166120,
      "at": "2026-11-08T00:37:12.414Z"
    },
    {
      "text": "A demanding week does not need a grand ending. Finishing one loose task and putting the rest in order can be enough.",
      "fingerprint": "f6af8a866e51d613feab343b21cb3218ff3f354226607cf13754df6164a8fa0c",
      "source": "ai",
      "slot": 166121,
      "at": "2026-11-08T03:00:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "text": "Practice explaining a difficult idea in your own words. The places where you hesitate can show you what to explore next.",
      "fingerprint": "999b63d2f4072d04e54d5b762d3186607d0e5e433b2bc42a53da05823ddd106a",
      "source": "ai",
      "slot": 166122,
      "at": "2026-11-08T06:00:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "text": "A reliable promise starts with an honest look at your time, your limits, and the help you may need.",
      "fingerprint": "db5b45893d3d5b9fba6aee80f6ad0fef63c4e6ce789f3465dd724f3cf38ef09e",
      "source": "ai",
      "slot": 166123,
      "at": "2026-11-08T10:23:56.725Z"
    },
    {
      "text": "Give a new routine a place in your real surroundings: a visible notebook, a prepared tool, or a time that already exists.",
      "fingerprint": "59fad7ed8031d8776fc828e8d49f8971efd6ad5f106db3015bd82b0fc14ebffd",
      "source": "ai",
      "slot": 166124,
      "at": "2026-11-08T12:00:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "text": "Keeping a record of what helped can spare your next attempt from having to discover everything again.",
      "fingerprint": "9feae3626923dea8cc0b849e7b6b5d4fcd9264a4ad3419fe9fbdd28f7f472168",
      "source": "ai",
      "slot": 166125,
      "at": "2026-11-08T17:56:51.764Z"
    },
    {
      "text": "A clear request gives other people a fairer chance to help than hoping they will guess what you need.",
      "fingerprint": "8c54afb56beb07b976e3b03927cef2b9112399ad10c6fae01d8a7d797ae46ec9",
      "source": "ai",
      "slot": 166126,
      "at": "2026-11-08T18:00:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "text": "A thoughtful ending matters too: save your notes, thank the people involved, and let the task be complete.",
      "fingerprint": "d3e1f24d0360c87c16c4258da5d24951448e5b5ce15ea4d149a92cab03cce408",
      "source": "ai",
      "slot": 166127,
      "at": "2026-11-08T22:06:09.795Z"
    },
    {
      "text": "When you return to a neglected skill, begin with the parts that feel familiar and let them welcome you back.",
      "fingerprint": "499a5fd75dace164ad19ad8570c58c3b3a476a8a33a4a15ff07126555351b1eb",
      "source": "ai",
      "slot": 166128,
      "at": "2026-11-09T00:00:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "text": "A quiet hour with something you enjoy can be worth protecting even when it produces nothing to share.",
      "fingerprint": "ebae662a32541d89430a7cac3af78ad65fe118fb1eaba1909e36d3160b0998e0",
      "source": "ai",
      "slot": 166129,
      "at": "2026-11-09T04:28:24.814Z"
    },
    {
      "text": "A useful conversation often begins when someone is willing to ask for a concrete example.",
      "fingerprint": "d1dd0c386ebad128e89eb5e96041b82f846f9d342caf4594a5666ccb4e333c85",
      "source": "ai",
      "slot": 166130,
      "at": "2026-11-09T06:30:49.599Z"
    },
    {
      "text": "You may not enjoy every stage of a worthwhile task. Make room to notice the parts that still hold your interest.",
      "fingerprint": "9ee9b8de95f54fb2ae15dcbafe9921e82bf885531ffd96a92559acb24cabf6b0",
      "source": "ai",
      "slot": 166131,
      "at": "2026-11-09T09:00:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "text": "When an attempt falls short, describe what happened plainly. A clear description gives revision somewhere to begin.",
      "fingerprint": "0ac868785634d99e2e9d5dc49c70c24a9bfd52c862c7c4d7c0f50fb28d626857",
      "source": "ai",
      "slot": 166132,
      "at": "2026-11-09T12:00:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "text": "An ordinary afternoon can hold a useful turning point: the call you make, the page you read, or the task you finally name.",
      "fingerprint": "60b981e02d82d2664dd28b13ef80bfe43b1bb4096d651fc5e42167ad7db008da",
      "source": "ai",
      "slot": 166133,
      "at": "2026-11-09T15:00:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "text": "Consider the pace you could keep on a tired Wednesday, not only the pace you can manage when everything goes well.",
      "fingerprint": "6a4fda4be02c376fb3d87fb85f5f09746cd6aa150a68f0ef2df323089ffa242f",
      "source": "ai",
      "slot": 166134,
      "at": "2026-11-09T19:50:05.346Z"
    },
    {
      "text": "Look at what the last week actually required of you before judging it by a plan made under easier conditions.",
      "fingerprint": "4c069782b8cb36b89c6d1a00104f3d8a66096561f6e2ae7bb51921408547530c",
      "source": "ai",
      "slot": 166135,
      "at": "2026-11-09T21:00:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "text": "Take interest in how things work before deciding whether you are the sort of person who could learn them.",
      "fingerprint": "cf6a00368a73d9197091967bc32becb659060aba97c7ad32b8720f43025ac216",
      "source": "ai",
      "slot": 166136,
      "at": "2026-11-10T00:00:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "text": "An experiment can end without the answer you wanted and still leave you with a better way to investigate.",
      "fingerprint": "c64f769f49c80467c9c636ea4c03204cc1a7b3682cd66b4e02bb2529d16da50c",
      "source": "ai",
      "slot": 166137,
      "at": "2026-11-10T03:35:07.364Z"
    },
    {
      "text": "A change of mind can deserve a calm explanation rather than a long apology for having learned something.",
      "fingerprint": "5eb9fda207e8dac8ce87ea58a3e97231053f1a90115da32de4572551cc7ba758",
      "source": "ai",
      "slot": 166138,
      "at": "2026-11-10T06:00:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "text": "The part you keep avoiding may need a clearer instruction, a shorter session, or another pair of eyes.",
      "fingerprint": "1bd4e8ca96c1644591a04cf8bfc7525c2f49c5792dfdc263afaf0d125fcead49",
      "source": "ai",
      "slot": 166139,
      "at": "2026-11-10T09:00:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "text": "Feeling out of place in a new room does not erase the experience and care you brought into it.",
      "fingerprint": "975ff33ff7302c046dc0cf31e00830882a1056efbb7f3344fe526d26bedabffe",
      "source": "ai",
      "slot": 166140,
      "at": "2026-11-10T14:54:28.788Z"
    },
    {
      "text": "You do not need to make your interests look consistent to other people before exploring where they lead.",
      "fingerprint": "a409854aafa6874b39ad601da9a86a59841d54de41b874a11bffe45102ae1167",
      "source": "ai",
      "slot": 166141,
      "at": "2026-11-10T15:00:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "text": "When you teach a beginner, remember how much effort can hide inside a question that sounds simple.",
      "fingerprint": "bc6688563570789f676a41b2c4855bebe6fdfdc9d1d9dc6050368a0b2a6c324b",
      "source": "ai",
      "slot": 166142,
      "at": "2026-11-10T18:00:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pay attention to the questions that remain interesting after the applause and excitement have faded.",
      "fingerprint": "d9a32bb5e83501b05969efa703e3d801d377af681d34eee70d8202246451cecf",
      "source": "ai",
      "slot": 166143,
      "at": "2026-11-10T21:18:46.534Z"
    },
    {
      "text": "You can admire another person's work without borrowing their timetable for your own life.",
      "fingerprint": "3db5ee771885de2e3cd66b96c31e8f641995ccd6c3aec2d8103f4f514bb9fdcc",
      "source": "ai",
      "slot": 166144,
      "at": "2026-11-11T00:00:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "text": "Allow a good moment to be a good moment without immediately asking how to make it bigger.",
      "fingerprint": "9db4622fc6a8cb4331b31106299e83abda8dbe055f9006d82ea76d7031c3c412",
      "source": "ai",
      "slot": 166145,
      "at": "2026-11-11T03:00:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "text": "The satisfaction of understanding one stubborn detail is a worthy reason to spend time learning.",
      "fingerprint": "532a334c44de132a283def276b3ab7ae8cdcc9dec82e1534157c7f65853c596a",
      "source": "ai",
      "slot": 166146,
      "at": "2026-11-11T06:22:32.515Z"
    },
    {
      "text": "Before adding another goal, notice which existing commitment needs a simpler path through your day.",
      "fingerprint": "531572b8ede2a97500a75c182db27e6046644fca42c212f9397694eefb37466e",
      "source": "ai",
      "slot": 166147,
      "at": "2026-11-11T09:00:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "text": "A walk with no lesson to extract and no result to record can still belong in a meaningful day.",
      "fingerprint": "232f1a07c0b66835374731868c1f8a68fb528914129103bd32e7201a5a5c3ee1",
      "source": "ai",
      "slot": 166148,
      "at": "2026-11-11T12:00:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "text": "Notice who makes it easier for you to be honest about what you have not figured out yet.",
      "fingerprint": "1f435e1f8c3c126be288800e5a427b16c246c64cf723a52a229c6940a59aed9b",
      "source": "ai",
      "slot": 166149,
      "at": "2026-11-11T17:08:05.835Z"
    },
    {
      "text": "When a choice feels tangled, write down what you know, what you assume, and what you still need to ask.",
      "fingerprint": "4570d4913091571a50aebabf067184efde209a3a773bbf04c847ae4e5c7a773f",
      "source": "ai",
      "slot": 166150,
      "at": "2026-11-11T18:00:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "text": "An awkward first conversation may become easier when you replace the need to impress with the wish to understand.",
      "fingerprint": "fdb76c36464170e14cb48087023a922ad5021b10c4931e34cac81ea77213f353",
      "source": "ai",
      "slot": 166151,
      "at": "2026-11-11T21:00:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sometimes the useful question is not how to do more, but which part no longer serves the work you care about.",
      "fingerprint": "c982c2681fa4f961c6a15e7ca489be76fc5f409f21ebc2efbbc33503b265a9aa",
      "source": "ai",
      "slot": 166152,
      "at": "2026-11-12T00:44:56.007Z"
    },
    {
      "text": "A rough draft makes room for a conversation that a blank page cannot begin.",
      "fingerprint": "846fba851f94a7c17498160ac0dcf45229b7c9f024deb7175b89a0b808320664",
      "source": "ai",
      "slot": 166153,
      "at": "2026-11-12T03:00:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "text": "You can accept encouragement without treating it as a demand to perform at your best every day.",
      "fingerprint": "31c782e1f0e59950d45f4cc8baf5ab710c60a95ec9264eecbb8661bbce03d2b1",
      "source": "ai",
      "slot": 166154,
      "at": "2026-11-12T06:00:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sharing a useful method can make your own learning matter beyond the task that first required it.",
      "fingerprint": "78682ce5afe91383bafba7318b215f3b62706508e5e19e00ab553b5866c26116",
      "source": "ai",
      "slot": 166155,
      "at": "2026-11-12T11:12:16.047Z"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remember the person you wanted to help when the details of a project begin to crowd out its purpose.",
      "fingerprint": "55a89ad56464ce71e3ede6a63c0e2eceb1fb1fc44c1ce4f66f83d8a8034b7e00",
      "source": "ai",
      "slot": 166156,
      "at": "2026-11-12T12:00:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "text": "Let a finished piece of work have its day before you compare it with the next thing you hope to create.",
      "fingerprint": "17f47a852cc69fe07956e24405d7c26affd84c6f0fbd7bd34b78b4c12ebf7b96",
      "source": "ai",
      "slot": 166157,
      "at": "2026-11-12T15:00:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "text": "You can be serious about your work and still leave room for laughter while you do it.",
      "fingerprint": "4b1a5cc7ff665d9e0fd0819063a9f62b3ca61a7427b5c4d089c31d4f64fc09dd",
      "source": "ai",
      "slot": 166158,
      "at": "2026-11-12T19:54:40.748Z"
    },
    {
      "text": "Revising an opinion after listening carefully is a sign that your understanding is still alive.",
      "fingerprint": "662a1e681a5e0e36829be6a5cb35bb5bc79602eeb94228009d114abaab776066",
      "source": "ai",
      "slot": 166159,
      "at": "2026-11-12T21:00:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "text": "There is room to enjoy being capable at something while accepting that someone else can still teach you.",
      "fingerprint": "dc97f4c6acfdbcb3ead0cb9210490c2bd8084d4eb6fcfee5ee7e394ba5f2058d",
      "source": "ai",
      "slot": 166160,
      "at": "2026-11-13T01:49:50.724Z"
    },
    {
      "text": "The next useful insight may come from noticing a detail you usually rush past.",
      "fingerprint": "d414ce3303da4194a99501fe3a184048e655af33fa5d3c1a57b5f4cdf97cc088",
      "source": "ai",
      "slot": 166161,
      "at": "2026-11-13T03:00:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "text": "Try leaving a little space between receiving feedback and deciding what it means about you.",
      "fingerprint": "346829dfd2b555c11cd3592780a33b93b3b89dd452ebc24b4306a5c8fa21cd63",
      "source": "ai",
      "slot": 166162,
      "at": "2026-11-13T06:00:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "text": "There is value in building something another person can understand, maintain, and make their own.",
      "fingerprint": "6f104978de2fc3c9626a50eb0d807108b8806f55289c6a043787c4504a21516c",
      "source": "ai",
      "slot": 166163,
      "at": "2026-11-13T10:59:23.676Z"
    },
    {
      "text": "Let an honest measure of progress include the questions you can now ask more clearly.",
      "fingerprint": "3f0c15c73e77959fef6ab503aba201e092c2ca77fb9dbdd4312054fc2cd1d74d",
      "source": "ai",
      "slot": 166164,
      "at": "2026-11-13T12:00:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "text": "You can test an idea on a modest scale before asking it to carry your whole plan.",
      "fingerprint": "e0fe5c9ca736c1b3b6b993a1805c0fe3ef34b529a9e53c6cc29b1471b83b78f9",
      "source": "ai",
      "slot": 166165,
      "at": "2026-11-13T15:00:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "text": "There is no need to turn every enjoyable activity into evidence that you are improving.",
      "fingerprint": "77c107cca8f5d927a8940749bb3eae5488c048c4ca72d9c38a1d78dcbb6c1f56",
      "source": "ai",
      "slot": 166166,
      "at": "2026-11-13T19:42:56.147Z"
    },
    {
      "text": "A task can be important without needing all of your evening. Decide what a reasonable stopping place looks like.",
      "fingerprint": "e331ae2749410dbde314f3450e0b611b7eafb129d202b8bc7d3ec7245b35e04b",
      "source": "ai",
      "slot": 166167,
      "at": "2026-11-13T21:00:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "text": "Choosing a different route can be a thoughtful response to what you have discovered along the way.",
      "fingerprint": "a1a2a5644645dd86e04ca8984c5e1429ca268d19033f7031001494eb10562881",
      "source": "ai",
      "slot": 166168,
      "at": "2026-11-14T01:26:55.910Z"
    },
    {
      "text": "When an old problem returns, look for the part you understand better this time.",
      "fingerprint": "15c3c24b1382e40eeb342886e86882edc70686e0a1b37d580f4d350de0d16a10",
      "source": "ai",
      "slot": 166169,
      "at": "2026-11-14T03:00:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "text": "If a result surprised you, stay with the surprise long enough to learn which assumption it challenged.",
      "fingerprint": "f2bdaeeb8943f49f6667dc93d09432f3ab25f7ecf48c5dbbbd2b7e69d8d1fb43",
      "source": "ai",
      "slot": 166170,
      "at": "2026-11-14T06:00:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "text": "You can mark a difficult experience honestly without making it the headline of every new possibility.",
      "fingerprint": "90e5390afc19ee7e375f4da7632157f60a6a5625cec9ccadf36b01499089f59c",
      "source": "ai",
      "slot": 166171,
      "at": "2026-11-14T10:27:03.797Z"
    }
  ],
